    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749140/extras/c6f431726d44f9416f482c46423f9c7d.webp?t=1753922331\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749140/extras/e2524c61b7e57b59092c1530966aeb87.avif?t=1753922331\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749140/extras/1d444d135c1f9bc73d17c8dd5e8dcb08.webp?t=1753922331\" /></div><br><br>The goal is to discover the best powerup to finish each level. This game features more than 30 levels that feature platforming challenges. <br><br>\u25cf Four Heroes with different abilities <br>\u25cf Unusual Clay sculpted pixel art graphics<br>\u25cf Side-scrolling gameplay<br>\u25cf Checkpoints save your progress<br>\u25cf One player platforming action game<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749140/extras/c6f431726d44f9416f482c46423f9c7d.webp?t=1753922331\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749140/extras/41fea622fd29a1492de3f5ab12fa1323.avif?t=1753922331\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749140/extras/c6f431726d44f9416f482c46423f9c7d.webp?t=1753922331\" /></div>",
